OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief says tackling        
OL,4,Aviolence against women and girls is    
OL,5,Anumber one priority                    
OL,7,FPolice Scotland's chief constable has  
OL,8,Fsaid the force is treating violence    
OL,9,Fagainst women and girls as its number  
OL,10,Fone priority.                          
OL,12,FJo Farrell said she was issuing what   
OL,13,Fshe called a "call to arms" to every   
OL,14,Fpart of the service, with the issue    
OL,15,Freceiving the same organisational      
OL,16,Fresponse as counter-terrorism and      
OL,17,Forganised crime.                       
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
