OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief says tackling        
OL,4,Aviolence against women and girls is    
OL,5,Anumber one priority                    
OL,7,FMore than 200 incidents are now being  
OL,8,Freported every day - an average of one 
OL,9,Fevery seven minutes - including rape,  
OL,10,Fsexual assault, domestic violence and  
OL,11,Fonline abuse.                          
OL,13,FFarrell said she accepted that a recent
OL,14,Fstring of rape convictions involving   
OL,15,Fformer police officers had eroded      
OL,16,Fpublic confidence in the force but said
OL,17,Fshe was determined to root out any sex 
OL,18,Foffenders.                             
